WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.260
A garden on a grid of one-metre squares.

2
00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:05.900
At the origin, a sprinkler spins.

3
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:10.530
Its spray reaches exactly thirteen
metres in every direction.

4
00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:12.200
It traces a circle.

5
00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:15.740
A plant at five, twelve
sits right on that edge.

6
00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:17.960
Another sits at twelve, six.

7
00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:20.700
Twelve and six are both under thirteen.

8
00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.840
So is that plant inside,
outside, or on the edge?

9
00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:29.550
In this mission, you'll find a point's
distance from the origin with Pythagoras.

10
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:34.620
You'll see why every point on this circle
satisfies x squared plus y squared equals

11
00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:36.460
one hundred and sixty-nine.

12
00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:40.390
Then you'll compare x squared
plus y squared with r squared,

13
00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.860
to tell inside from outside.

14
00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:45.590
Your mission: decide
whether the plant at twelve,

15
00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:46.920
six gets wet.
